{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Footsteps: metal grate",
  "description": "Eight steps of work boots running along a steel catwalk deep inside a steel hull, as a seamless loop. Each step: the rubber heel lands with a dull thud and the heavy grating panel clanks, a dense, sour, low clang of many crowded bars, no one note; a moment later the panel knocks down onto its frame and its bars tick against each other; the ball of the foot follows with a lighter second clank, at this pace so close behind the heel that the two close to one hard clang. No two steps are alike: the feet differ in weight and timing, and most steps land on a sound panel but some on a shorter, bent one that chatters on its clips. At a run the rattle grows and the catwalk under the panels hums; Speed takes it back to a slow walk, where heel and toe come apart. The hull answers each step, hard and metallic.",
